#N canvas 80 80 980 880 12;
#X text 20 10 Samples player (v1.38: was the vox player). ockm-vox-load is a path under samples (vox/set/voice/01.wav). ockm-smp-user <folder> <n> plays the nth file of samples/user/<folder> (voice \, loops or hits). The whole file plays from the start to its end: no gate. A new file takes over. Only stopping the transport fades it out. ockm-vox-pitch is semitones. ockm-smp-stut 0 plays through \, 1 chops a 16th (set per hit).;
#X obj 700 30 table \$0-vox;
#X obj 40 40 loadbang;
#X obj 420 40 r ockm-vox-pitch;
#X obj 420 70 v ockm_voxpitch;
#X msg 500 40 0;
